sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Dashboard
  participant PS as Payment Service
  participant Provider as Card Provider
  participant CS as Chip Service
  participant Redis as Redis Pub/Sub
  participant ACS as Access Control Service

  UI->>PS: POST /payments/card {amount, chip_id, purpose=recharge}
  PS-->>UI: {transaction, checkout_url}
  UI->>Provider: Redirect to checkout_url
  Provider-->>PS: Webhook /webhooks/provider (succeeded)
  PS->>Redis: Publish payment.events (payment.updated)
  UI-->>PS: Poll /transactions/{id} (optional)
  UI->>PS: POST /recharge?chip_id&transaction_id
  PS-->>UI: recharge completed
  PS->>Redis: Publish payment.events (recharge.completed)
  Redis-->>ACS: payment/recharge event (optional use)
  ACS->>CS: (optional) validate chip/balance for immediate UI refresh

